  "description": "Powerful TWAIN library for easy scanning using TWAIN drivers: scan with scanner software, silent scan, 32-bit/64-bit/AnyCPU, scan to image (TIFF, BMP, JPEG, PNG), scan to PDF, multi-page scan (PDF, TIFF), protect PDF. This version is available only for Windows",
